direction: right
title: Project Tungsten Execution Engine Architecture

OffHeap: 1. Off-Heap Memory {
  style.stroke: "#38BDF8"
  Problem: Heavy JVM object headers (16B) & GC pauses
  Solution: Binary format via sun.misc.Unsafe
  Benefit: Zero Java object allocations & Zero GC pauses
}

CacheAware: 2. Cache-Conscious Computation {
  style.stroke: "#FBBF24"
  Problem: Memory fetch latency (100ns) & CPU cache misses
  Solution: 64-byte cache line alignment + 8-byte key prefix
  Benefit: Sort & search execute entirely in CPU L1/L2 cache
}

CodeGen: 3. Whole-Stage CodeGen {
  style.stroke: "#C084FC"
  Problem: Volcano iterator next() virtual function calls
  Solution: Janino compiles entire stage into a single loop
  Benefit: Data stays in CPU registers; SIMD vectorized speed
}

OffHeap -> CacheAware: Binary pointers { style.stroke: "#FBBF24" }
CacheAware -> CodeGen: L1 cache residency { style.stroke: "#C084FC" }
